### REST contract — Global search typeahead (D69)
### GET /api/v1/search?q=...&limit=... — grouped typeahead across the org's
### objects: devices, POIs, tours, media, annotation layers, functions,
### flows, dashboards, edge refs (wifi + hosts merged).
###
### ADDITIVE endpoint: pnex_api_contract::CONTRACT is NOT bumped.
### Deliberate D14 deviation: NO {count, next, previous, results} envelope —
### typeahead shape {count, q, groups:[{entity_type, results:[...]}]}, empty
### groups omitted, canonical group order (device, poi, tour, media, layer,
### function, flow, dashboard, edge_ref).
### Matching: case-insensitive containment, `lower(col) LIKE pattern
### ESCAPE '\'` — portable PG/sqlite (never PgExpr::ilike, which panics on
### sqlite). Wildcards `%`, `_`, `\` in the term are escaped (literal).
### Tokenization: the term is split on whitespace; each token is stripped
### of EDGE punctuation ("esp---" → "esp" — search noise, not literals) and
### tokens are ANDed ("esp32 relay" matches "esp32-relay-1"). Internal
### punctuation stays significant ("esp32-relay", "100%d" are literals).
### If stripping empties every token, the raw term is one literal token.
### Ranking: prefix matches before substring matches, recency first within
### each class.
### Auth: Bearer JWT + X-Org-Id; cross-org objects invisible (org_id filter,
### masked — never 403).
### limit = PER-GROUP cap (default PAGINATION_DEFAULT_LIMIT, max 100,
### capped at 20); absent/empty q → 200 {count:0, q:"", groups:[]} (silent
### default, never 400).

### Variables (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP): {{token}} {{org_id}}

### Search — 200, grouped typeahead
GET http://localhost:5150/api/v1/search?q=alpha&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Org-Id: {{org_id}}

### Empty q — 200, empty groups (never a 400)
GET http://localhost:5150/api/v1/search
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Org-Id: {{org_id}}

### Escaped wildcards: q="%" matches titles holding a literal percent only
### (unescaped, it would match everything)
GET http://localhost:5150/api/v1/search?q=%25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Org-Id: {{org_id}}

### No token — 401
GET http://localhost:5150/api/v1/search?q=alpha
